abstract: >-
  Vehicle-integration paper for a single-stage-to-orbit spaceplane powered by a
  continuous CHARM proton–boron-11 plant with direct energy conversion, Shuttle-class
  cargo, and municipal-runway ops to ISS-altitude LEO. The reactor and combined-cycle
  engine are detailed in full in two companion papers/repos: charm_compact_p11b and
  electric_3_stage_ssto_engine.
